  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fca Us has $512M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Fca Us received 11,836 awards for a current-year average award size of $43.3K. Fca Us obligations are up 101.5% year over year. Fca Us fiscal-year history shows uneven flows: FY21 was $267M, FY22 was $16.1M, FY23 was $356M, FY24 was $330M, FY25 was $254M, and FY26 is $512M. Fca Us totals are partial because the reporting period is fiscal year to date and figures are obligations except where otherwise labeled. Fca Us had its largest FY26 obligations so far compared with prior years listed. Fca Us award-count and average-award metrics indicate a program with many relatively small awards alongside a few larger obligations driving the total. Fca Us stakeholders who track seasonality or contracting spikes should note the fiscal-year values when comparing years, and treat FY26 as an in-progress total rather than a closed-year sum.",
